      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, la gente recibió el maíz. Pero el mundo seguía a oscuras.",
          "en": "Last time, the people received maize. But the world was still in darkness."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se reunieron en Teotihuacan, de noche.",
          "en": "The gods gathered at Teotihuacan, in the night."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Códice Florentino cuenta que se preguntaron: \"¿Quién va a encargarse de alumbrar el mundo?\"",
          "en": "The Florentine Codex says they asked: \"Who will take on the task of lighting up the world?\""
        }
      ],
