        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se sentaron a esperar. ¿Por dónde iba a salir el sol?",
          "en": "The gods sat down to wait. Where would the sun come out?"
        },
        {
          "es": "Unos miraron al norte, otros al sur, otros al oeste.",
          "en": "Some looked north, others south, others west."
        },
        {
          "es": "Miraron a todos lados. Algunos acertaron: Quetzalcóatl y Tezcatlipoca miraron al este.",
          "en": "They looked in every direction. Some guessed right: Quetzalcoatl and Tezcatlipoca looked east."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y el cielo empezó a ponerse rojo.",
          "en": "And the sky began to turn red."
        }
      ],
